Challenge 4 — Move limit medium

Give the player a maximum number of moves based on difficulty. Show a "Game Over" dialog when they run out — same floating dialog pattern as ResultBanner. Add a progress bar showing remaining moves.

Challenge 5 — Matched pair animation medium

When a pair is matched, make the cards bounce or pulse briefly before settling into the cyan color. Use a CSS keyframe animation triggered by the isMatched class.

Challenge 6 — Leaderboard stretch

Store the top 5 scores in localStorage as an array. Show them on a leaderboard screen accessible from the main menu. Each entry shows rank, moves, time, and date played.

Challenge 7 — Multiplayer (2 players) stretch

Two players take turns. Track each player's matched pairs separately. When a player finds a match they get another turn. When all pairs are found, the player with more matches wins.
